// This file defines DISPLAY/UI metadata only. The actual trained model
// (feature list, category vocabulary, and linear-SVM weights) lives in
// js/model_weights.js (MODEL_WEIGHTS), auto-generated by
// matlab/generate_features_and_export_weights.m.
//
// Each modality lists the MATLAB column/feature names (matching
// MODEL_WEIGHTS.features) that belong to it, in display order.
//
// SCALING TO NEW EPILEPSY TYPES / MODALITIES
// - New epilepsy type: add a key to MODEL_VERSIONS with its own `modalities`
//   array and `status: "active"` (plus a matching MODEL_WEIGHTS export).
// - New modality/feature for an existing type: add an entry to that type's
//   `modalities` array — the UI and scoring engine are fully data-driven.
// =============================================================================

